WEBVTT

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:31.504
and much of my own work is also focused
on people who are female identifying.

00:01:31.546 --> 00:01:35.133
But this much is clear
regardless of gender identity:

00:01:35.174 --> 00:01:37.468
the brain is the biggest sex organ,

00:01:37.510 --> 00:01:40.972
and everyone can benefit
from expanding their sexual imagination.

00:01:42.181 --> 00:01:43.432
I first started thinking

00:01:43.474 --> 00:01:45.768
about this connection
between sex and imagination

00:01:45.768 --> 00:01:47.061
while I was in college.

00:01:47.061 --> 00:01:49.230
Back then, among my friends,

00:01:49.230 --> 00:01:52.358
the definition of sex
was extremely narrow.

00:01:52.358 --> 00:01:56.946
It essentially meant penetrative sex
between a guy and a girl.

00:01:58.072 --> 00:02:00.950
And masturbation
wasn't a topic of conversation.